1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,364
As Uke comes to grab your wrist with both hands

2
00:00:02,365 --> 00:00:03,283
extend towards him

3
00:00:03,284 --> 00:00:06,583
using his momentum lead him around 
in a big circular movement,

4
00:00:06,584 --> 00:00:09,242
as he comes round continue the movement to his rear

5
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:10,258
raising the arm up

6
00:00:10,259 --> 00:00:12,077
turning again and cutting down,

7
00:00:12,078 --> 00:00:14,412
as you draw Uke´s head towards your body

8
00:00:14,413 --> 00:00:16,546
step in again deeply again to his rear

9
00:00:16,547 --> 00:00:18,229
turning his body completely around

10
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:21,995
as he comes round in front of you, 
extend away for the throw.

